{
  "source": "Prompts/make-your-move-v11.mp4",
  "duration": 181.0346875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.66,
      "text": "Imagine you started a basketball team with friends."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.26,
      "end": 6.14,
      "text": "You spent months learning the fundamentals, running drills,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.72,
      "end": 8.68,
      "text": "and practicing until everyone got better."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.4,
      "end": 12.14,
      "text": "But eventually someone stops and asks, what's next?"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.84,
      "end": 15.24,
      "text": "Are we joining a league or just practicing forever?"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.12,
      "end": 18.52,
      "text": "That is exactly where you are right now with AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.24,
      "end": 20.36,
      "text": "You have learned the fundamentals."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.04,
      "end": 24.28,
      "text": "You know how these models work, and you have built important skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.02,
      "end": 28.02,
      "text": "Now you have to decide what you are actually going to do with them."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.02,
      "end": 30.68,
      "text": "When thinking about how AI will change careers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.4,
      "end": 34.38,
      "text": "it is easy to worry that entire professions will disappear."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.18,
      "end": 36.28,
      "text": "But we have to look closer."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.12,
      "end": 38.7,
      "text": "A job is not a single action."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.26,
      "end": 41.16,
      "text": "It is a collection of distinct tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.88,
      "end": 44.64,
      "text": "And AI will not affect every task in the same way."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.3,
      "end": 46.78,
      "text": "The same logic applies to a teacher."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.58,
      "end": 51.0,
      "text": "AI excels at drafting lesson plans or creating practice activities."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.78,
      "end": 53.96,
      "text": "But humans still own the core responsibilities,"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.96,
      "end": 57.34,
      "text": "knowing the individual student, building motivation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.92,
      "end": 59.68,
      "text": "adapting a lesson in the moment,"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.22,
      "end": 61.84,
      "text": "and cultivating a classroom community."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.66,
      "end": 63.86,
      "text": "If you are an electrician,"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.18,
      "end": 68.28,
      "text": "AI can read complex manuals and suggest possible causes for a failure."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.02,
      "end": 72.3,
      "text": "But you still have to work safely with live wires in the real world,"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.74,
      "end": 74.68,
      "text": "diagnose the actual physical environment,"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.28,
      "end": 76.78,
      "text": "and adapt your tools on site."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.38,
      "end": 80.0,
      "text": "For a graphic designer, AI generates quick drafts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 83.68,
      "text": "color variations, and possible visual directions in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.46,
      "end": 87.22,
      "text": "But a human designer must still determine the project's purpose,"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.7,
      "end": 88.98,
      "text": "understand the target audience,"
    },
    {
      "start": 89.36,
      "end": 92.12,
      "text": "apply artistic taste, and direct the final result."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.7,
      "end": 95.72,
      "text": "Because humans will remain responsible for the most important work,"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.16,
      "end": 99.94,
      "text": "you need to build capabilities that you can carry into almost any career path."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.72,
      "end": 104.98,
      "text": "Here is a breakdown showing four practical moves you can make, starting right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.34,
      "end": 108.14,
      "text": "You do not need to choose your entire future today."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.14,
      "end": 111.4,
      "text": "These steps work whether you have a specific career in mind"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.4,
      "end": 113.38,
      "text": "or are still exploring your options."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.16,
      "end": 116.02,
      "text": "First, learn from people in the field."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.56,
      "end": 118.9,
      "text": "Talk to someone doing a job you are interested in."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.22,
      "end": 121.46,
      "text": "Ask them what a normal week actually looks like,"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.46,
      "end": 123.0,
      "text": "how their industry is changing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.54,
      "end": 125.72,
      "text": "and what students usually misunderstand about their work."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.82,
      "end": 128.16,
      "text": "Second, build real depth."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.94,
      "end": 130.38,
      "text": "Choose a subject worth learning seriously."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.38,
      "end": 133.74,
      "text": "Take the class, put in the reps, seek out feedback,"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.26,
      "end": 136.46,
      "text": "and push yourself to learn enough about the topic"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.46,
      "end": 139.72,
      "text": "that you can spot the errors and nuances that an AI might miss."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.56,
      "end": 142.14,
      "text": "Third, make something real."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.78,
      "end": 145.5,
      "text": "Use AI to build a project, organize a local event,"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.14,
      "end": 148.44,
      "text": "start a small business, or solve a specific problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.16,
      "end": 151.72,
      "text": "Keep the finished work as tangible proof of your abilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.56,
      "end": 154.12,
      "text": "Fourth, step into responsibility."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.06,
      "end": 158.5,
      "text": "Join a club, volunteer in your community, or help lead a team."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.0,
      "end": 162.04,
      "text": "Put yourself in a position where you are responsible for delivering a result"
    },
    {
      "start": 162.04,
      "end": 163.4,
      "text": "that matters to other people."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.56,
      "end": 167.22,
      "text": "By understanding how these models work"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.22,
      "end": 169.74,
      "text": "and where human judgment remains critical,"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.36,
      "end": 172.46,
      "text": "you know how to be smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.32,
      "end": 173.7,
      "text": "Keep learning."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.46,
      "end": 174.88,
      "text": "Keep building."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.7,
      "end": 176.18,
      "text": "Make your move."
    }
  ],
